  "description": "Love is a jungle, and only the fierce survive.\n\nKidnapped and held captive in the jungle, Tristan's only ally is Jia, a girl who was sold off to the cartel that killed his mother. She protects him—but as love grows, so does the danger. Can they escape together and make those who shattered their lives pay the price?\n\n(Source: Manta)",
